141	            style="font-family: var(--font-typewriter); letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase;"
142	          >
143	            Pulling the piece from the wire…
144	          </p>
145	        )}
146	
147	        {missing.value && !isLoading.value && (
148	          <div
